<title>USA: American Greetings to disclose new strategy.</title>
<headline>American Greetings to disclose new strategy.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Greetings Corp said Monday it will disclose a new strategy for addressing emerging marketplace trends at a news conference on Wednesday, June 4, at 1000 at the company's headquarters in Brooklyn, Ohio.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to provide details.</p>
<p>American Greetings makes greeting cards, giftwrap, stationery and other gift items.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
